              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Chief Justice Roberts asked whether \u201cother property\u201d includes any type of property."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "192c0093cd7c4cbd877b6d57a0128aed093b72b6ecb888d824f7f3051b327818",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-192c0093cd7c-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 8,
              "start": 8
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Scalia, justice Scalia inquired about a later statute that makes an exception to the exception."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "192c0093cd7c4cbd877b6d57a0128aed093b72b6ecb888d824f7f3051b327818",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-192c0093cd7c-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Stevens asked whether there had ever been a debate in earlier stages of the litigation as to whether this was a detention."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "192c0093cd7c4cbd877b6d57a0128aed093b72b6ecb888d824f7f3051b327818",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-192c0093cd7c-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Souter, justice Souter questioned whether Congress intended to cover all law officers and whether mentioning customs and excise was merely to clarify inclusion."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "192c0093cd7c4cbd877b6d57a0128aed093b72b6ecb888d824f7f3051b327818",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-192c0093cd7c-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 37,
              "start": 37
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked about the frequency with which other law\u2011enforcement officers assist customs and revenue agents."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "192c0093cd7c4cbd877b6d57a0128aed093b72b6ecb888d824f7f3051b327818",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-192c0093cd7c-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 46,
              "start": 46
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Souter warned against isolating the phrase \u201cany officer of customs or excise\u201d from the statute as a whole."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "192c0093cd7c4cbd877b6d57a0128aed093b72b6ecb888d824f7f3051b327818",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-192c0093cd7c-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 55,
              "start": 55
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked whether the parties would have In Forma Pauperis (IFP) status."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "192c0093cd7c4cbd877b6d57a0128aed093b72b6ecb888d824f7f3051b327818",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-192c0093cd7c-0003-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 56,
              "start": 56
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Roberts, chief Justice Roberts thanked counsel and noted that the case was submitted."
      }
    ],
